=== full commit msg c0da306d ===
fix(filters): correct drawer layout, checkbox spacing, and grey[150] token

DrawerContent: remove flex:1 1 auto from body so CLEAR/APPLY buttons flow
naturally after accordion content. Figma content-container is shrink-0;
ZimmDrawer's overflowY:auto wrapper owns the scroll.

ZimmCheckbox: use Chakra spacing prop instead of paddingLeft sx; increase
swatch boxSize from icon-size-sm to icon-size-md; widen label gap from
zimm-scale-2xs to zimm-scale-s to match Figma filter item layout.

ZimmCheckboxGroup: replace bare Chakra spacing={1} with var(--zimm-scale-m).

ZimmCheckbox stories: hoist useState into module-scope CheckedInteractive.

ZimmDrawer: tighten hasOverlay JSDoc.

colour.ts + zimmTokens.ts (Tier 1 — bryanian09 verified): add grey[150]
= #dddddd as a named primitive; back border.tertiary with it instead of a
raw literal; register --zimm-color-grey-150 in zimmTokens.ts to satisfy
the foundation-collision-guard test.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

